            <ArticleTitle>Palliative care for patients with mesothelioma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>219-225</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.12968/hmed.2017.78.4.219</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Mesothelioma is a highly symptomatic aggressive cancer affecting quantity and quality of life. Excellent palliative care is essential from diagnosis. This article discusses commonly encountered issues and management strategies including the rationale for early referral to specialist palliative care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
